{{Documentation}}
Invoked with [[User:CursedXyster/StageList]].<br>
Creates a list of stages (like in the Encounters section of most enemy pages), but has magnifications to go alongside them.

Formatted like so:
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/StageList|enemy|chapter1|stage1|mag1|chapter2|stage2Link*stage2Display|mag2|…}}</nowiki>
Since vertical bars would disrupt the arguments, use asterisks instead if you want to have the linked page display a different name.


For example:
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/StageList|Fallen Bear|Stage 19|Sahara (Aku Realm)*Sahara|100|Stage 40-5|Fishermen On Strike|200}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/StageList|Fallen Bear|Stage 19|Sahara (Aku Realm)*Sahara|100|Stage 40-5|Fishermen On Strike|200}}